  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/B5fL8rHg/ender-eyes-gui.png\" width=\"302\" height=\"302\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RjWCgrnBZz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1066142815043719208?color=7289da&label=Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=7289da&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"272\" height=\"41\"></span></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xYmrwP9/description.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> Ender Eyes GUI 是一个专为 “Beyond The End” 整合包独家制作的模组。</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 它允许玩家了解开启“新末地传送门”所需收集的全部 24 颗末影之眼，并提供简要的寻找指南。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 本模组仅适用于客户端。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dcZcCdK/banner-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"94\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>艺术家</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🛈</span> Incognitoankh:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fankhasmodeus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fiverr 链接</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🛈</span> Lopolycookie: <a href=\